window.RTLBenchLSData.register("assets/d3770b9dc1c1aa3bd559d7773be57c7bd21fd9302d8f97fe9cac0e44600aca22.txt","This module implements a simple pass-through register interface with handshaking signals. It directly connects input data `d` to output `z`, input load signal `ld` to output `lz`, and input valid signal `vz` to output `vd`. The module has configurable width and resource ID");
